cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link to https://autorepaircost.net"
title: "Australian Car Repair Cost Dataset: 30 brands x 40 repair types, 1,200 price ranges in AUD"
authors:
  - name: "AutoRepairCost Dataset Project"
    website: "https://autorepaircost.net"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
url: "https://autorepaircost.net/dataset-2026"
repository-code: "https://github.com/qixiaobo/au-repair-cost-dataset"
keywords:
  - "car repair costs"
  - "Australia"
  - "automotive"
  - "maintenance pricing"
  - "open data"
  - "AUD"
abstract: >-
  1,200 rows of Australian car repair price ranges covering 30 brands and
  40 repair types, in AUD. Each row gives a fitted total range plus labour
  and parts components, with per-row provenance (URL-anchored, estimated,
  or curated) and a confidence grade. Indicative market ranges, not
  workshop quotes. Data vintage 2026-11-11. CC BY 4.0; attribution must
  link to https://autorepaircost.net.